    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>What devices are compatible with this magnetic power bank?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>This magnetic power bank is compatible with iPhone 16/15/14/13/12 series, Apple Watch Ultra 2 / Ultra / 10 / 9 / 8 / 7 / 6 / 5 / 4 / 3 / SE, and AirPods with wireless charging case. It works with MagSafe-compatible cases, allowing you to snap your iPhone on instantly for wireless charging.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Will the magnetic power bank work with phone cases?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes, it works with MagSafe-compatible cases. For the best magnetic connection and charging efficiency, we recommend using MagSafe cases or going caseless. Thick or non-magnetic cases may weaken the magnetic attachment.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is this power bank safe for daily and travel use?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The charger includes an advanced smart safety system with protections against overcharging, overcurrent, overheating, and short circuits. The low-temperature core also helps reduce heat during charging, ensuring safe and stable performance wherever you go.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I use the ring stand while charging my phone?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The built-in 360° rotatable ring stand allows you to hold your phone securely or prop it up for hands-free viewing while charging. It’s perfect for watching videos, making video calls, or browsing comfortably.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does this magnetic charger support fast charging?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. With fast charging support, your iPhone 16 can reach up to 56% in about 30 minutes (wired) and fully charge wirelessly in about 2.5 hours. The Apple Watch Series 10 can charge to 100% in around 2 hours and 10 minutes.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_pBWhpp": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How strong is the magnetic connection? Will the phone fall off?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>The charger features a powerful 1000g magnetic force, ensuring a strong and secure attachment to your iPhone. Once attached, your phone stays firmly in place, even while texting, watching videos, or moving around.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_yFJgQL": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is this power bank allowed on airplanes?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The 10,000mAh battery capacity is within airline safety limits, making it airplane-approved for carry-on luggage. It’s a perfect travel companion for flights, business trips, and vacations.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
